        "Wrong: Wien's displacement law is purely classical. Correction: the displacement form was found empirically, but its constant follows from Planck's quantised spectrum.",
        "Wrong: the peak of B_nu converts directly to the peak of B_lambda by ν = c/λ. Correction: spectral densities transform with a Jacobian, so their maxima occur at different physical frequencies.",
